        "id": 1657088753,
        "content": "@devpanther I don't understand how the current PR solves the original [issue](https://github.com/ubiquity/devpool-directory-bounties/issues/10). This \"create PR\" [script](https://github.com/devpanther/bounty-bot/blob/7344b9ee275e57174a9f71d0daeb593df9c9ea6b/src/handlers/pull-request/create-devpool-pr.ts) will work both for `devpool` and `devpool-directory` because https://github.com/ubiquity/devpool redirects to https://github.com/ubiquity/devpool-directory.\r\nThis \"unexpected\" [issue](https://github.com/ubiquity/devpool-directory/issues/734) was created because the [sync workflow run for a closed PR](https://github.com/ubiquity/devpool-directory/blob/development/.github/workflows/sync-issues.yml#L6) even if it was not [merged](https://github.com/ubiquity/devpool-directory/pull/732). So we should refactor the sync workflow to run **only** on push to the `development` branch.",
